The contract fails to restrict application deletion, allowing any user to delete it.

### Vulnerability: Arbitrary delete
### Explanation: The contract does not check for or handle DeleteApplication transactions in its approval program. Any DeleteApplication transaction will bypass the UpdateApplication check and be approved by the default success return, allowing unauthorized deletion of the application.
### Risk: Critical - Allows complete and irreversible destruction of the application by any user.
